{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your co-worker Nanako have always had a bitter rivalry. Finally, on the order of your boss, you two have to cooperate for once. What bottled up feelings will this predicament reveal? Where did it all go wrong between you and her? And how will she eventually help you to reconnect what you've lost in touch with: that there is more to life than just being a productive workaholic?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Visual Novel for the Heart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras/ebb34cc7b798e13ac199a9dab2668137.avif?t=1773908114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras_big/ebb34cc7b798e13ac199a9dab2668137.avif?t=1773908114 width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office Rivals is a <u>slice-of-life</u>\u00a0indie visual novel inspired by wholesome doujin and webtoons; the kind of a feel good story to experience on a nice day with a warm cup of tea or coffee!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the wholesome slice-of-life genre in doujin and webtoons, for fans of the genre!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various sexy scenes animated scenes, each drawn frame-by-frame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime for steady-paced readers: approximately 5-6 hours.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slice of Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Office Rivals is a <strong>slice of life visual nove</strong>l, and was created as a doujin in VN form. It is fairly linear with one true ending but also has some alternate endings. If you're looking for more adventurous stories, it might not be your cup of tea. <strong>If you love slice of life</strong> though, it's made for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Setting and Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras/ee05f95ef34ca3a8ba697bd7e6ed6c2d.avif?t=1773908114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras_big/ee05f95ef34ca3a8ba697bd7e6ed6c2d.avif?t=1773908114 width=800 height=222 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A flawed protagonist: the protagonist is not a perfect ladies' man. Despite being a  talented and well-dressed company star, he is a workaholic with insecurities and trust issues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grounded side-characters with relatable personalities: not everyone has the perfect life! Overtime, commute issue, work confidence; they're all a part of our daily challenges!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An 'authentically Asian' setting: Heart City is a <i>fictional city</i> that's inspired by <i>real-life</i> places, settings and cultures.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras/223c496a6db05c85997f9c744ef8c637.avif?t=1773908114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras_big/223c496a6db05c85997f9c744ef8c637.avif?t=1773908114 width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Love interest:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nanako Takagi, 29, is the protagonist's coworker and work rival. Talented and beautiful, she secretly has feelings for him. But what does she see in him? And how did their rivalry start?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras/25c86c66a483c0282b48b513f12af130.avif?t=1773908114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras_big/25c86c66a483c0282b48b513f12af130.avif?t=1773908114 width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colleagues:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seon: The boss who's strict but also caring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gee: Upbeat and easy-going, but nervous about meeting his girlfriend's parents!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Michelle: Composed and dedicated, with an underlying fear of coming out of her shell.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other coworkers: Hanie, Liem, intern Mami, and Sayori.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras/2c340ce75ee20a327ab003509624f9fb.avif?t=1773908114\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras_big/2c340ce75ee20a327ab003509624f9fb.avif?t=1773908114 width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Other characters:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Isamu: Someone from Nanako's past! Smug, rich and arrogant!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yejin: The boss' wife who can help the protagonist with his workaholism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emi: Gee's girlfriend who likes to talk about scary rumours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mei and Min: The father-and-daughter duo who run the late night food stall the protagonist likes to visit.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431020/extras/ee62273e